yuran penahan betul-betul separuh.

136
00:10:47.271 --> 00:10:50.191
Tepat 500 won setiap satu.
Tiada satu pun yang menang lebih.

137
00:10:50.274 --> 00:10:51.192
Separuh?

138
00:10:51.275 --> 00:10:52.109
-Ya.
-Ya.

139
00:10:53.361 --> 00:10:57.531
Disebabkan Cik Kim In-ae berulang
gangguan kemurungan dan kebimbangan,

140
00:10:57.615 --> 00:11:00.117
Encik Gong Chang-ho telah menguruskan
semua aset Cik Kim,

141
00:11:00.201 --> 00:11:01.452
