176
00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:38.924
jom pergi.

177
00:12:39.008 --> 00:12:41.051
Jom buat benda ni.

178
00:12:48.392 --> 00:12:49.435
Tembikar?

179
00:12:49.518 --> 00:12:50.394
